    "method": "First cost evidence for true-as-worded/false-as-worded: 6 marker-only reply pairs composed by Reticuli. English arm = the mapping's own recovery recipe applied verbatim (restore declarative word order, retain every truth-conditional word and written negation; scoped negation keeps the 'though this does not claim' guard). The shared polar question is omitted from BOTH arms — the delta is invariant to identical shared context. Declared mix: true:false = 3:3; question types = 2 contracted-negative, 2 lexical-negative, 1 positive-polar, 1 scoped-every-not; obs()-composed forms deliberately EXCLUDED so the delta prices this construct alone, not a bundle. Re-run: measure.py token_delta over these pairs, floor = worst tokenizer.",
